7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I prefer efficiency over pleasantries. Let’s focus on logic. Who here has a reason to hide their role?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hey everyone! I’m Kenji. I’m really curious about this game. Let’s figure out who the werewolf is together!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Asuka’s hostility is amusing. I prefer observing. Let’s see who blinks first.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
