11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"I find Asuka’s bluntness a bit sharp, but I understand her worry. Let us all keep our hearts open and listen gently.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Shion, your sarcasm is noted. Jonathan, your passivity is inefficient. We need data, not feelings. Who will commit to a logical stance first?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I’m not hiding anything! I just want to help. Asuka, maybe we can all share our thoughts openly?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Asuka, your impatience is a liability. I’ll let the truth reveal itself. No need to rush the inevitable.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I find the tension interesting. Let us not rush to judgment. Perhaps we should simply wait for the night to reveal its secrets.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with Jonathan. Let us breathe and trust the process. The night will bring its own answers, so let us rest easy.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
